<decisions apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" [
  <decision #track.migrate_businessobject_pageobject_to_xnl.xnl_owner_authority { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "medium" } (
    <question ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G0>
    谁拥有 object-operation definition 与 target kinds？
    </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G0>
    <answer {  } (
      <raw-answer ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G1>
      XNL owner resource。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G1>
      <decision-text ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G2>
      PageObject / BusinessObject XNL owner document SHALL 是 operation definition 与 target-kind 的唯一 authority；binding 只拥有实现和 contract facts。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G2>
      <rationale ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G3>
      避免 registry、handler 与 authoring 形成多重 authority。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G3>
      <evidence ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G4>
      用户确认的稳定 API 与 XNL channel allocation decision。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G4>
    )>
  )>
  <decision #track.migrate_businessobject_pageobject_to_xnl.four_dimensions { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 1 reversibility = "medium" } (
    <question ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G5>
    对象 operation handler 的稳定调用形状是什么？
    </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G5>
    <answer {  } (
      <raw-answer ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G6>
      fn(runtime, targets, invocation, config)
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G6>
      <decision-text ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G7>
      所有 PageObject / BusinessObject operation handler SHALL 接收 runtime、targets、invocation、config 四个独立参数；action 读取 invocation.input，mutation 读取 invocation.desired。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G7>
      <rationale ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G8>
      target identity、semantic payload、host effect runtime 与调用配置不得混写。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G8>
      <evidence ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G9>
      用户明确给出的核心结果。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98G9>
    )>
  )>
  <decision #track.migrate_businessobject_pageobject_to_xnl.private_binding { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "medium" depends_on = ["track.migrate_businessobject_pageobject_to_xnl.xnl_owner_authority"] } (
    <question ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GA>
    PageObject export 与 BusinessObject resource binding 是否进入 public catalog？
    </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GA>
    <answer {  } (
      <raw-answer ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GB>
      不进入。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GB>
      <decision-text ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GC>
      Public catalog SHALL 只发布共同 definition；不同 binding 通过 discriminated capsule-private map 表达。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GC>
      <rationale ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GD>
      binding 是实现 Effect，不是调用 Data。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GD>
      <evidence ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GE>
      参考 assembly closure design。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GE>
    )>
  )>
  <decision #track.migrate_businessobject_pageobject_to_xnl.separate_object_entry { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true confidence = 0.99 reversibility = "medium" } (
    <question ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GF>
    对象操作是否复用 generic callable entry？
    </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GF>
    <answer {  } (
      <raw-answer ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GG>
      不复用。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GG>
      <decision-text ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GH>
      Compiler SHALL 生成独立 run_object_operation(call)；BusinessAction/BusinessMutation MUST NOT 作为 generic callable 或独立 AI reference 暴露。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GH>
      <rationale ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GJ>
      对象操作拥有 targets/invocation/config 语义，flat callable 会破坏边界。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GJ>
      <evidence ?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GK>
      参考 compiler migration track。
      </?01M02KBYJKPF2BKYASVPBJ98GK>
    )>
  )>
]>
